+That binary is outside both pins, the semver range `>=0.128.0,<0.156.0`
+and the 0.155.0 payload manifest. `check_pair_rail.py --verify-codex-pin`
+returns `mismatch` / `payload_sha256_mismatch` (exit 1), and
